    {"t":"Text","x":172,"y":300,"w":628,"h":14,"o":[0,0],"text":"Mostly the plot beats in briefings and debriefings. Some jokes stay; most of the in-jokes and repetition go.","font":"Krel Regular 12px","asked":"ui 13px","color":"#e5e7eb","wrap":660},
